// fields are never renamed, new fields append with fresh numbers, and removed
// fields are reserved. The example clients under examples/engine-client-*
// lock this contract in CI with a byte-exact extract → process → merge round
// trip against the CLI.
//
// Errors are reported as gRPC status errors (InvalidArgument for bad
// headers/unknown names, Internal for engine failures) — not in-band strings.

